Bionic sysroot (armeabi-v7a)

The files in this directory are byte-for-byte copies of libraries from the
Android Open Source Project (AOSP), taken from the Android 7.0 (API 24)
armeabi-v7a emulator system image:

  system/bin/linker
  system/lib/libc.so
  system/lib/libm.so
  system/lib/libdl.so
  system/lib/libstdc++.so
  system/lib/libz.so
  system/lib/libc++.so

